@startuml Sample App Product State Machine
[*] --> Draft : ProductRecord received

Draft --> Validated : Constraint validation checks out (name & positive price)
Draft --> ValidationFailed : Violates constraints (name blank / negative price)

Validated --> UpperCased : ProductInterceptor.beforeCreate() executes
UpperCased --> Saved : Saved to database with generated ID

Saved --> [*]
ValidationFailed --> [*]
@enduml
